+ * `toRoman` writes, so "IIII", "VV", "IC" and "MMMM" are rejected.
+ * @param {string} s Upper-case Roman numeral, such as "MCMXCIV".
+ * @returns {number} An integer from 1 to 3999.
+ * @throws {Error} If `s` is not a string, or is not a standard Roman numeral.
+ */
